SUMMARY:Genshin Impact Version 7.1 "A Rekviem for the Underworld" Special Program
DESCRIPTION:miHoYo will host the Genshin Impact Version 7.1 “A Rekviem for the Underworld” Special Program on September 12 at 5:00 a.m. PT / 8:00 a.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on Twitch (English)\, YouTube (English\, Japanese\, Korean)\, and Bilibili (Chinese). \nThis special program will feature the latest information about new game content and developments in Version 7.1\, as well as “drop” some redemption codes and other bonuses.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/genshin-impact-version-7-1-a-rekviem-for-the-underworld-special-program
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_Genshin_09-12-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
