SUMMARY:tinyBuild Connect 2026
DESCRIPTION:tinyBuild will host tinyBuild Connect 2026 on September 14 at 8:00 a.m. PT / 11:00 a.m. ET\, the publisher announced. You will be able to watch it on YouTube\, Twitch\, and Bilibili. \nThe broadcast will feature new game announcements\, demos\, updates\, and trailers\, including the long-awaited return of Kingmakers with a 10-minute gameplay deep dive\, new looks at The Lift and Grave Yardyard Keeper 2\, updates for Hozy\, Of Ash and Steel\, and SAND: Raiders of Sophie\, and “so much more.”
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/tinybuild-connect-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_tinyBuild-Connect_09-14-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
